# Wi-Fi on/off, on the scripts page of the instr selector.
# A .ui entry is not run as a program: Nebulae itself handles it (ui.py,
# mode = the name after the number, here "wifi").
# Speed click on it: Wi-Fi on if it is off, off if it is on, and back to the
# instrument. Saved (configsettings.py, Code/config/configsettings.txt), so
# after a restart it is as it was; switched by Code/scripts/wifi.sh.
# Slot LED bright = Wi-Fi on (nebulae-status).
